 TableBrowse_WithParms;table;parms
⍝ Shows a table with the Table.Browse method but specify lots of things via the parameters.
 →0 ⍝ <Table>
 . ⍝ The "Table" class is under construction and not ready yet
 table←_CreateTable

 parms←##.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'Table.Browse with parameters'
 parms.posn←55 35
 parms.dataTypes←##.APLGUI.Enums.TableDataTypes.(Char Numeric Char Char Date Time Currency YesNo)
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Type' 'Parent' 'Author' 'Date' 'Time' 'Amount' 'Active'
⍝parms.modalWait←0
⍝parms.rowTitles←0
 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp' ⋄ 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.⎕IO←0 ⋄ #.TEMP.⎕ML←3
 #.Temp.MyFont←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'APL385 Unicode')('Size' 16)('Weight' 100))
 parms.fontInput←#.Temp.MyFont
 parms ##.APLGUI.Table.Browse table
⍝Done
